  "releaseNotes": "Version 1.0.3 compiles the Shared Project source directly into the plugin assembly so the NuGet package contains one versioned plugin DLL and each tool remains independently deployable.\n\nVersion 1.0.2 provides an explicit public PNG icon URL for XrmToolBox Tool Library validation.\n\nVersion 1.0.1 added a 128 x 128 package icon and dedicated public documentation URL.\n\nVersion 1.0.0 introduced table and column usage searches across forms, views, business rules, classic workflows, business process flows, Power Automate flows, and plugin steps.",
